        "text": "[{\"text\":\"In addition, we have some who are working or not in this University, Lam Sing-\",\"y\":0.8950139622972556,\"width\":0.7506807458254938,\"x\":0.1278033199834817,\"height\":0.01780195826427944},{\"text\":\"Che （F.5 in 67-68） who is in a high school in Ottawa and his brother who has been here\",\"y\":0.879360465364153,\"width\":0.8071278727290099,\"x\":0.06918240063759143,\"height\":0.016079273907291802},{\"text\":\"for at least six years. James Siu （F.5 in 62-63） who is working. Tsang Shiu-Lun is in\",\"y\":0.8612139233237383,\"width\":0.8093987480156397,\"x\":0.06699666312422765,\"height\":0.018184266727211518},{\"text\":\"Pre-Arts of St. Patrick's College. Finally, Cho-Hing's brother, Cho Lun （F.5 in 61-62）\",\"y\":0.8439341648650005,\"width\":0.8072607950119062,\"x\":0.06911169110658345,\"height\":0.019675297069238873},{\"text\":\"and my eldest brother, Sze Sam （same yr.） are also working here. So is Foo Hi-Loy.\",\"y\":0.8297267482313782,\"width\":0.8051870925630585,\"x\":0.07120641725079188,\"height\":0.016837171622906988},{\"text\":\"James Siu is planning for a reunion of some sort around Christmas but up to\",\"y\":0.8007584723647818,\"width\":0.7464747173205256,\"x\":0.12781672412040349,\"height\":0.016735964100989875},{\"text\":\"now we can't do much because our Mid-term Exams. are still going on. Anyway 1 am\",\"y\":0.7817621434174307,\"width\":0.803231154089252,\"x\":0.07114200750866119,\"height\":0.020767375933619214},{\"text\":\"sure I can send you a photo of some of the boys above. So until next time, I wish you\",\"y\":0.7655276364032731,\"width\":0.8031383094536394,\"x\":0.07117650953424921,\"height\":0.01821267193225773},{\"text\":\"a very merry Christmas.\",\"y\":0.7499207730206757,\"width\":0.23311578386365978,\"x\":0.06892710995861002,\"height\":0.016953046469424415},{\"text\":\"Yours respectfully，\",\"y\":0.7162632396224191,\"width\":0.17571774587694022,\"x\":0.5926077445698739,\"height\":0.022282407182823927},{\"text\":\"Tan Sze-Yiu.\",\"y\":0.7004999684838575,\"width\":0.1179674494860874,\"x\":0.6244882302427395,\"height\":0.012985914149579614},{\"text\":\"Pisghessive Club '69\",\"y\":0.5673587699809539,\"width\":0.4448800863012994,\"x\":0.24716163205470218,\"height\":0.051328970943289365},{\"text\":\"After the Hong Kong School Certi-\",\"y\":0.5145348841222004,\"width\":0.3312369029923418,\"x\":0.11530398451011831,\"height\":0.01315241201692774},{\"text\":\"ficate Examinations\",\"y\":0.4999999998889957,\"width\":0.18029350216166656,\"x\":0.06918238717912481,\"height\":0.013081395276594576},{\"text\":\"the Form 5 boys\",\"y\":0.49671661043079474,\"width\":0.197777763359522,\"x\":0.24919913441776695,\"height\":0.017643794951299085},{\"text\":\"were all busily hunting for schools and jobs.\",\"y\":0.481104651085444,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"x\":0.0712788320094289,\"height\":0.014660820976530764},{\"text\":\"The lucky ones got back to our Alma\",\"y\":0.46511627901180064,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"x\":0.0691823859437408,\"height\":0.01468828120526744},{\"text\":\"Mater. More than half went to different\",\"y\":0.4504885993642782,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"x\":0.07127882215617971,\"height\":0.013174191204655128},{\"text\":\"schools to continue their studies. A few\",\"y\":0.43159609114784947,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"x\":0.06918239438713679,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"took up positions in society. We all missed\",\"y\":0.4142441862113291,\"width\":0.3794549348100894,\"x\":0.06498951101663848,\"height\":0.016048973158050428},{\"text\":\"the happy schooldays we spent together.\",\"y\":0.3996742673102648,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"x\":0.06708595642867704,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"Still there were occasions of seeing one\",\"y\":0.38152299510329213,\"width\":0.3758410564146284,\"x\":0.06889274934333321,\"height\":0.01892119603358966},{\"text\":\"another again. To keep up old ties the\",\"y\":0.3644217910644133,\"width\":0.37778143465575026,\"x\":0.06690207628244767,\"height\":0.01913043777018497},{\"text\":\"Progressive Club was formed with all the\",\"y\":0.35016286674653063,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"x\":0.06918238469985558,\"height\":0.016116202537710622},{\"text\":\"Form 5 boys of the school year 1968-69\",\"y\":0.3321873215085226,\"width\":0.37553223460099655,\"x\":0.06694920260782804,\"height\":0.017027814535830688},{\"text\":\"as members.\",\"y\":0.3197674421069536,\"width\":0.10901467439036043,\"x\":0.06708595452389736,\"height\":0.011627906774464902},{\"text\":\"The Club produced a souvenir album\",\"y\":0.2892441857753665,\"width\":0.33123687428342546,\"x\":0.1111111204403978,\"height\":0.014664608958489755},{\"text\":\"to recall happy memories of our Wah Yan\",\"y\":0.2732558141668394,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"x\":0.06498952595434448,\"height\":0.014692068565940297},{\"text\":\"days in the years to come. A list of\",\"y\":0.25726744177342853,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"x\":0.06708594793811123,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"text\":\"names, addresses and telephone numbers\",\"y\":0.2412790700597005,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"x\":0.0670859489468855,\"height\":0.013118323907013396},{\"text\":\"of all classmates was printed in the album\",\"y\":0.2237785014916196,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"x\":0.06708595832843667,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"to enable us to keep in constant touch with\",\"y\":0.2078175893272023,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"x\":0.06498951093601484,\"height\":0.01311264286600422},{\"text\":\"one another.\",\"y\":0.19315960884686312,\"width\":0.10901467439036042,\"x\":0.06708595478595186,\"height\":0.011782251662462495},{\"text\":\"To thank the teachers for their help\",\"y\":0.16115931439228337,\"width\":0.3339634749088664,\"x\":0.10871848920664516,\"height\":0.019071402534211468},{\"text\":\"and work for us during the years, we in-\",\"y\":0.1452768728028111,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"x\":0.06708595125296514,\"height\":0.01606033648264138},{\"text\":\"vited them to a Graduation Dinner held at\",\"y\":0.13224755700282542,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"x\":0.06498951093601484,\"height\":0.011726384364820763},{\"text\":\"the school hall. It was a happy occasion\",\"y\":0.11335504867720814,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"x\":0.06498953629676199,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"for both teachers and students.\",\"y\":0.09878043611156517,\"width\":0.2811705050105098,\"x\":0.06487469188322549,\"height\":0.013376528587714098},{\"text\":\"Reunion Dinner\",\"y\":0.33284883749861804,\"width\":0.1174004196784234,\"x\":0.6205450743536605,\"height\":0.008844973598318706},{\"text\":\"I sincerely wish our Progressive Club\",\"y\":0.3037790697022076,\"width\":0.3354297541046861,\"x\":0.5303983263019547,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"text\":\"a long life to serve its purpose ot keeping\",\"y\":0.28824131366087646,\"width\":0.3692129427603921,\"x\":0.49252973433296404,\"height\":0.016013412599843124},{\"text\":\"our trlendship lasting. A re-election of the\",\"y\":0.2790697676625242,\"width\":0.36897273525693797,\"x\":0.4926624839438579,\"height\":0.01018104677479903},{\"text\":\"staff will be held once a year.\",\"y\":0.26308139531994024,\"width\":0.2662473805984684,\"x\":0.4884696044334702,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"text\":\"Liang Ka Bun\",\"y\":0.23680781747312474,\"width\":0.12159328514522572,\"x\":0.7337526232554793,\"height\":0.011738693908293851},{\"text\":\"Secretary•\",\"y\":0.21712971615150534,\"width\":0.08645952140399005,\"x\":0.7490082715294837,\"height\":0.017406120673064684},{\"text\":\"Staff of the year °68 — '69\",\"y\":0.19185667777109117,\"width\":0.25157232993297274,\"x\":0.5492662464800544,\"height\":0.017589576547231256},{\"text\":\"Chairman\",\"y\":0.169979138206664,\"width\":0.07761112475103626,\"x\":0.5282803924725631,\"height\":0.010332421293476113},{\"text\":\"Ng Ka Kay, Michael\",\"y\":0.16416938099233558,\"width\":0.18658280753909928,\"x\":0.6771488491355117,\"height\":0.01606317700314608},{\"text\":\"Vice Chairman：\",\"y\":0.15250454592282803,\"width\":0.1307881194695144,\"x\":0.5278987213233258,\"height\":0.013379351090918923},{\"text\":\"Chan Pui Wing，\",\"y\":0.14820846904083962,\"width\":0.15303982638684732,\"x\":0.6771488514397,\"height\":0.01603571677440918},{\"text\":\"Lawrence\",\"y\":0.1394202538448438,\"width\":0.08181998108426913,\"x\":0.6792157966430735,\"height\":0.010403678471568312},{\"text\":\"Treasurer\",\"y\":0.12638436493729865,\"width\":0.0775681331487389,\"x\":0.5262054503281464,\"height\":0.011726384364820874},{\"text\":\"Secretary\",\"y\":0.1094103733159294,\"width\":0.07274885348071491,\"x\":0.5254426066260653,\"height\":0.013158570827024318},{\"text\":\"Chan Pui Yan, Paul\",\"y\":0.12209302304523084,\"width\":0.18658280753909917,\"x\":0.6792452849359012,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"text\":\"Liang Ka Bun，\",\"y\":0.10749185639365821,\"width\":0.14465408109878442,\"x\":0.6687631037902305,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"Patrick\",\"y\":0.09593023306842141,\"width\":0.06289308248324321,\"x\":0.6771488458652966,\"height\":0.01319028810880074},{\"text\":\"65\",\"y\":0.06250000002846512,\"width\":0.023060795953558588,\"x\":0.8385744235378957,\"height\":0.011767100977198686}]",
